    "title": "Tate McRae Sends Fans Into a Frenzy With Her Legs on Full Display in Tiny White Shorts - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Taylor Swift isn’t the only pop star teasing new work this week. Pop singer Tate McRae , 22, has fans playing internet sleuth after a recent social media post that appears to hint at new lyrics—alongside a show-stopping onstage look. Related: Ronda Rousey, 38, Looks 'Incredible' in Wonder Woman Bikini 8 Months After Giving Birth The \"Greedy\" singer shared a photo Wednesday of herself performing in a crop top and tiny white shorts, showing off her toned dancer’s legs. The So You Think You Can Dance Canada alum captioned the image, \"piss me off and I'll turn out,\" which many fans believe could be a lyric from an upcoming release. \"Tate McSlay,\" wrote one clever fan in her comment section, while another added, \"So gorgeous.\" Related: Rosie O'Donnell, 63, Is Unrecognizable As She Debuts 'New Smaller Body' While fans were quick to praise McRae’s killer legs and confident stage presence, much of the buzz surrounded the caption itself. Social media turned into a group chat of fans trying to decode what many see as an Easter egg for new music. With Taylor Swift dropping major album news and Tate McRae potentially teasing a new track, pop fans have their work cut out for them keeping up. 🎬 SIGN UP for Parade's Daily newsletter to get the latest pop culture news & celebrity interviews delivered right to your inbox 🎬",
